      "text": "I never really got to explain this journal clearly so I\u2019m going to start being transparent, this journal was gifted to me in October of last year when I started to learn how clothes are made. I decided to document everything I\u2019ve been learning by writing and putting Polaroids in it. I\u2019ve carried this with me ever since and what I have started doing is scanning the pages and putting them online for anyone else learning about clothing. I\u2019m grateful for who I\u2019ve met and what I\u2019m continuously learni",
